					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1606633#post-3714046</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1606633/date-night#post-3714046</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 18 Feb 2018 08:34:28 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Hercules Rockefeller</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2314402</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Thanks DrChandra, I appreciate it! :)</p> <blockquote> <p>Some people would say it's wrong for a man to love an anomalous homicidal stature made of concrete and re-bar. They're wrong.</p> </blockquote> <p>You are so right. Clef's just following his heart - who are we to judge?</p> <blockquote> <p>By sheer coincidence, my placeholder title for City of Wonder was Date Night, and if I hadn't have changed it, I would have discovered this monstrosity when I tried to post instead of the next day.</p> </blockquote> <p>Huh, that <em>is</em> super weird. And now I'm intrigued by <em>City of Wonder</em> - I'm going to have to check out the <em>Dread &amp; Circuses</em> canon when I get the time. It looks really interesting, and I love me some Herman Fuller stuff!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1606633#post-3714038</guid>
				<title>Re: Another Audio Adaptation</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1606633/date-night#post-3714038</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 18 Feb 2018 08:26:56 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Hercules Rockefeller</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2314402</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>How have you been, TheeSherm? Thank you so much for the audio adaptation, I absolutely love it! The voice acting and the music were terrific (I love that you used <em>the</em> song), and I especially liked how much fun you seemed to be having recording this. I'm also very happy you chose to release this on St-Valentine's day! It just feels so appropriate.</p> <p>Thanks for reading and for the kind words. :)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1606633#post-3710910</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1606633/date-night#post-3710910</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 15 Feb 2018 06:58:16 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DrChandra</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1956625</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Some people would say it's wrong for a man to love an anomalous homicidal stature made of concrete and re-bar.</p> <p>They're wrong.</p> <p>By sheer coincidence, my placeholder title for <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/city-of-wonder">City of Wonder</a> was Date Night, and if I hadn't have changed it, I would have discovered this monstrosity when I tried to post instead of the next day.</p> <p>+1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
