				<wikidot:authorName>Hercules Rockefeller</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2314402</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So I received this great <a href="https://www.dropbox.com/s/4bml9i5i7eb5ssp/Date%20Night.mp3?dl=0">reading</a> of <em>Date Night</em> in the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-1998814/the-5th-annual-x-mas-art-exchange">2016 Christmas Art Exchange</a>.</p> <p>The reading was from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/toadking07" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1632267&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1485135903" alt="toadking07" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1632267)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/toadking07" >toadking07</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dj-scip" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2126811&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1485135903" alt="DJ Scip" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2126811)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dj-scip" >DJ Scip</a></span>, best known for their <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-773027">Foundation After Midnight</a> podcast series. If you're not familiar with the series I highly recommend you check it out, it's a lot of fun.</p> <p>Thanks to the both of them for a really nice gift! :)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
