				<wikidot:authorName>Hercules Rockefeller</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2314402</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm really glad you commented on the horror aspect of the tale, I wasn't sure if I'd managed to convey this as much as I'd intended to.</p> <p>As for your theory re: the ending&#8230;I love it. To be honest that possibility hadn't occurred to me, and when I had Clef say there was no danger I kind of had in mind the fact that in lolFoundation the senior staff avatars are all reality benders; however, I deliberately didn't elaborate too much on this in order to allow people to come up with their own interpretations for Clef's claim.</p> <p>But yeah, your idea's going straight into my headcanon: reality bender or not, Clef is so overconfident, not to mention in love, that 173 could easily catch him off-guard. I just hope the D-class don't take Clef at his word, or, like you say, everyone's dead.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
